      "notes": "One prefix per design DIMENSION (PD-UIX / PD-API / PD-SCH / PD-IND); a prefix's multiple 'directories' entries are facets WITHIN that dimension, never a second dimension borrowing a pool (PF-PRO-064 correction C-10). Not to be confused with PD-INT (Integration Narratives) - the two mnemonics are one letter apart and describe unrelated artifacts. The terminal PD-TDD references a PD-IND; a PD-IND is never housed under PD-TDD.",
